# TMDB API Read Access Token (v4 auth Bearer token)
# Obtain from: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api ("API Read Access Token")
# NOTE: Never commit your actual token or credentials to version control.
# Note: Stored as TMDB_TOKEN (non-VITE prefix) so it is accessed securely by the server-side proxy only.
TMDB_TOKEN=your_read_access_token_here
